ts own values and rules, and each teaches different talents that shape your build and story path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176140/extras/228c875d821fa7123cd4dd317bfa93a3.poster.avif?t=1786989960\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176140/extras/228c875d821fa7123cd4dd317bfa93a3.webm?t=1786989960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176140/extras/228c875d821fa7123cd4dd317bfa93a3.mp4?t=1786989960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character growth</strong><br>Talents for melee, ranged and magic are only the start. You also learn crafting, resource gathering and unique character perks that open new options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat</strong><br>Victory depends on reflexes and knowing your foes. Use a broad arsenal of weapons and spells to control distance, punish mistakes and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful quests</strong><br>Many quests have more than one outcome with different rewards. Those rewards are often of similar value, so you can choose the resolution that fits your playstyle instead of chasing a single best answer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176140/extras/a6b8fdc41895d082abf83bd7bd58831d.poster.avif?t=1786989960\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176140/extras/a6b8fdc4189